[198.087848, "o", "Lithuania: 7082.7\r\n\r\nTotal countries with 2025 total reserves: 9\r\n\r\n=== STEP 3 CANDIDATES ===\r\nBelarus -> Belarus: Gold=7471, TotalRes=14425.9\r\nGeorgia -> Georgia: Gold=1002, TotalRes=6158.7\r\nMoldova -> Moldova: Gold=10.71, TotalRes=5999.34\r\nUzbekistan -> Uzbekistan: Gold=55092.42, TotalRes=66311.75\r\nCzechia International Reserves -> Czechia International Reserves (EOP, NSA, Mil.US$): Gold=10121.89, TotalRes=175830.49\r\nLatvia -> Latvia: Gold=921.28, TotalRes=6076.9\r\n\r\nMatching countries for STEP 3: 6\r\n"]
